Template action ({{}})
- Anything in between Template Action  {{ .Chart.Name }} is called Action Template
- Anything in between Template Action {{ .Chart.Name }} will be rendered by helm template and replace 
  necessary values.
- Anything outside of the template action will be printed as it is.
- Action template defined inside the {{  }} will help us to retrive data from other sources

Valid Action Template
- create a basic chart 
- then in templates folder create a deployment.yaml file and in that add the content
and in that in name add {{ .Release.Name }}-{{ .Chart.Name }}
----------------------------
Helm Quote Function and Pipeline
Example of Quote:
app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: {{ quote .Release.Service }}

Example of Pipeline
app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: {{ .Release.Service | quote | upper }}

--------------
Default Template function
- it is use to set a default function
Example: default "foo" .bar
- the the above example if .bar is evaluated to be empty it will use foo
the defination of "empty" depends on type:
- Numeric: 0
- String: ""
- Lists: []
- Dicts: {}
- Boolean: fasle
- And always nil (aka null)
--------------------------------

Controlling White Spaces:
{{- .Chart.Name}}: if the hyphen is added before the statement, {{- .Chart.Name}} then the leading
space is removed.
{{ .Chart.Name -}}: if the hyphen is added after the statement, {{ .Chart.Name -}} then the trailing
space will be ignored during the rendering.

